      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Diana and Abe, can you take a look at this CL? It updates pd_chipset_resume, pd_chipset_suspend, pd_chipset_startup and pd_chipset_shutdown to send a Power State Change alert on DFP ports. This is talked about in Section \"6.4.6.4.1 Power State Change\" of the USB PD 3.1 spec.",
      "revId": "f1daa93e9052f74de88ac601ab56d96d5cdfb686",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
