        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-09T20:44:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At least the way pd_send_alert_msg is written right now, you could just not check the config here. If the PE is disabled, the function would return an error code, but you\u0027re not checking the return value anyway.",
      "revId": "f1daa93e9052f74de88ac601ab56d96d5cdfb686",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4b5c9502_9592b78d",
